36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:33,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mess up... the village, you say?!</font>

38
00:01:33,860 --> 00:01:36,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you do that
no matter what!</font>

39
00:01:36,650 --> 00:01:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean, there's no way
just the four of you can do that!</font>

40
00:01:40,370 --> 00:01:42,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, we can...</font>

41
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:45,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A person who knows village matters
very well gave us information</font>

42
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on where and how to attack.</font>

43
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:49,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knows village matters very well...</font>

44
00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:52,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It couldn't be!</font>

45
00:01:52,670 --> 00:01:54,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean Orochimaru?!</font>

46
00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:56,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows...?</font>

47
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:02,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that's how it is,
so we can't have you guys living.</font>

48
00:02:02,810 --> 00:02:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you see this?</font>

49
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Paper Bombs!</font>

50
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:10,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to detonate
the Paper Bombs</font>

51
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after we've left here...</font>

52
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nowhere to run...</font>

53
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:15,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no chance of someone
coming to save you.</font>

54
00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:17,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prepare yourselves.</font>

55
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:19,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's better than going back
to the Academy, isn't it?</font>

56
00:02:20,110 --> 00:02:22,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rest in peace.</font>

57
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:25,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Just a minute!</font>

58
00:02:27,830 --> 00:02:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Farewell, real me.</font>

59
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:36,960
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Dash, Wonder, Zigzag Run!</font>

60
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:36,960
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Chased, Chased</font>

61
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:36,960
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">and Mistaken</font>

62
00:02:41,970 --> 00:02:43,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It should've just been
hunting for treasure,</font>

63
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:45,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but to think this would happen...</font>

64
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:47,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, nothing good comes</font>

65
00:02:47,890 --> 00:02:50,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of being together with you
on missions, Naruto!</font>

66
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:51,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't the time to be saying that!</font>

67
00:02:52,150 --> 00:02:56,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're attempting to mess up
the Leaf Village by impersonating us!</font>

68
00:02:57,400 --> 00:03:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then how're we going
to get out of here?!</font>

69
00:03:00,150 --> 00:03:01,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

70
00:03:01,820 --> 00:03:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I use the Rasengan,
I could somehow...</font>

71
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:06,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They'd notice that!</font>

72
00:03:07,330 --> 00:03:09,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be the end if we were
to get ambushed outside.</font>

73
00:03:10,290 --> 00:03:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, with your Fang Over Fang...</font>

74
00:03:13,210 --> 00:03:14,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That'd be the same, the same!</font>

75
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:16,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You moron!</font>

76
00:03:17,340 --> 00:03:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then what should we do?!</font>

77
00:03:21,090 --> 00:03:23,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I use
my Protective 8 Trigrams 64 Palms...</font>

78
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it!</font>

79
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:28,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With that we can weather this crisis
without the guys outside noticing!</font>

80
00:03:28,730 --> 00:03:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I could just loosen
these ropes a little...</font>

81
00:03:31,730 --> 00:03:34,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave that to me!</font>

82
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:41,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto?!</font>

83
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:42,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

84
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me, too!</font>

85
00:03:46,530 --> 00:03:47,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba...</font>

86
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:51,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

87
00:03:57,380 --> 00:03:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a little more...</font>

88
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It snapped...</font>

89
00:04:20,780 --> 00:04:21,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Protective 8 Trigrams...</font>

90
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">64 Palms!</font>

91
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then,
shall we go as arranged?</font>

92
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Kiba!
— Yeah!</font>

93
00:04:45,590 --> 00:04:46,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hinata!
— Yes!</font>

94
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:47,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

95
00:04:48,220 --> 00:04:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know!</font>

96
00:05:05,610 --> 00:05:06,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

97
00:05:08,320 --> 00:05:09,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You okay?</font>

98
00:05:14,830 --> 00:05:15,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

99
00:05:15,870 --> 00:05:22,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Hinata!
Cut our ropes before you faint.</font>

100
00:05:26,430 --> 00:05:27,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

101
00:05:30,890 --> 00:05:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems the guys outside
are gone.</font>

102
00:05:36,060 --> 00:05:38,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't look like this place
is going to hold up now.</font>

103
00:05:38,350 --> 00:05:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be best for us
to escape as soon as we can.</font>

104
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:46,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?!</font>

105
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the buried treasure chest.</font>

106
00:05:48,030 --> 00:05:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it be!</font>

107
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a fake anyway.</font>

108
00:05:50,660 --> 00:05:52,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there might be
some kind of trap set.</font>

109
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:56,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's our mission to
take this back with us, so...</font>

110
00:05:56,460 --> 00:05:59,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There really might be
buried treasure in it, right?!</font>

111
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:00,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

112
00:06:03,050 --> 00:06:06,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks empty inside...
Wait, there's paper inside.</font>

113
00:06:07,550 --> 00:06:09,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it a Paper Bomb?</font>

114
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:12,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't seem to be
anything dangerous...</font>

115
00:06:13,260 --> 00:06:15,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I guess I'll take it for now.</font>

116
00:06:15,430 --> 00:06:18,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, there's no need
to go to the trouble of...</font>

117
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:22,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it might make for a good mark
to distinguish him from the imposter...</font>

118
00:06:22,980 --> 00:06:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it.</font>

119
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:29,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru, you're the mark for
the real me, so stay close to me.</font>

120
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:35,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time.</font>

121
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:39,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be going with our Fang Over Fang.
Make sure you keep up!</font>

122
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

123
00:06:44,710 --> 00:06:45,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man-Beast Clone...</font>

124
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:48,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fang Over Fang!</font>

125
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You okay, Hinata?</font>

126
00:06:59,730 --> 00:07:04,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm fine... I just have to follow
after Kiba, so... I'll be o...</font>

127
00:07:06,780 --> 00:07:07,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

128
00:07:12,070 --> 00:07:13,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

129
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:26,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You okay, Hinata?</font>

130
00:07:27,630 --> 00:07:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

131
00:07:33,050 --> 00:07:34,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does your leg hurt?</font>

132
00:07:34,930 --> 00:07:35,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba...</font>

133
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:39,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If your leg hurts, say so first.</font>

134
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:43,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was thinking
I must not cause trouble, so...</font>

135
00:07:43,730 --> 00:07:45,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, that is trouble.</font>

136
00:07:47,020 --> 00:07:48,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

137
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:54,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Surprisingly, this might be
the weakness of our team.</font>

138
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:59,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata shows too much
concern for us.</font>

139
00:07:59,910 --> 00:08:03,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and I speak too bluntly
to each other and we get into fights...</font>

140
00:08:03,460 --> 00:08:05,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that you mention it...</font>

141
00:08:06,290 --> 00:08:09,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we'd take on our missions while being
a little conscious of stuff like that,</font>

142
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:12,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we might...
become a pretty good team.</font>

143
00:08:15,010 --> 00:08:15,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it!</font>

144
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll try...</font>

145
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:22,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right. Then Naruto and I will go
after those guys.</font>

146
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:27,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, you come later.
Your leg's hurt, so don't force things...</font>

147
00:08:27,730 --> 00:08:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it.</font>

148
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up. You're hurt, Hinata.
So you follow later.</font>

149
00:08:33,530 --> 00:08:36,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just said that, didn't I?</font>

150
00:08:36,070 --> 00:08:37,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you?</font>

151
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:40,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right... Thanks...</font>

152
00:08:42,330 --> 00:08:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Naruto!</font>

153
00:08:47,290 --> 00:08:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to hurry, too...</font>

154
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:54,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm back!</font>

155
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:56,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're back, Naruto?</font>

156
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:07,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We couldn't catch up
with them, huh...?</font>

157
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto? Kiba?!</font>

158
00:09:10,190 --> 00:09:12,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was I here just now?!</font>

159
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

160
00:09:13,940 --> 00:09:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That one was an imposter!</font>

161
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:16,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?!</font>

162
00:09:17,530 --> 00:09:19,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the dog didn't notice anything...</font>

163
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:22,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can't be sniffed out even
with the nose of a Ninja Hound!</font>

164
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:23,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru was fooled, too!</font>

165
00:09:25,370 --> 00:09:27,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've got trouble!
To the Hokage, immediately.</font>

166
00:09:27,290 --> 00:09:27,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

167
00:09:28,290 --> 00:09:31,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru! You remember the smell
of that Agari old man, right?!</font>

168
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:33,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After him!</font>

169
00:09:37,470 --> 00:09:38,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

170
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've just received
a communication...!</font>

171
00:09:42,310 --> 00:09:43,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody realizes it.</font>

172
00:09:44,430 --> 00:09:48,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay sharp.
Our mission isn't over yet, so...</font>

173
00:09:48,730 --> 00:09:50,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.
The crucial part comes now.</font>

174
00:09:53,110 --> 00:09:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Someone's coming!</font>

175
00:10:01,490 --> 00:10:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We found you, imposters!</font>

176
00:10:06,330 --> 00:10:08,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll kick your butts!</font>

177
00:10:12,710 --> 00:10:14,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, you're alive...</font>

178
00:10:14,130 --> 00:10:15,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naturally!</font>

179
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time it's your turn
to prepare yourselves...</font>

180
00:10:18,590 --> 00:10:21,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, this is our home field.</font>

181
00:10:24,100 --> 00:10:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are times when you lose</font>

182
00:10:26,430 --> 00:10:28,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even when fighting
on your home field!</font>

183
00:10:30,270 --> 00:10:31,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won't let you get away!</font>

184
00:10:34,860 --> 00:10:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata?!</font>

185
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:38,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to inform the Hokage!</font>

186
00:10:39,570 --> 00:10:41,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, you go after the imposters!</font>

187
00:10:41,570 --> 00:10:43,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got... it.</font>

188
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:45,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

189
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:52,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Upon careful thought,
the real Hinata hasn't come yet...!</font>

190
00:10:52,500 --> 00:10:54,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You imposter!</font>

191
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:59,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

192
00:11:03,220 --> 00:11:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing to Hinata?!</font>

193
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:09,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just like I'm the imposter.</font>

194
00:11:10,020 --> 00:11:10,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

195
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:12,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?!</font>

196
00:11:13,310 --> 00:11:14,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

197
00:11:15,230 --> 00:11:17,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's an imposter!</font>

198
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

199
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:23,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prepare yourself, imposter!</font>

200
00:11:24,030 --> 00:11:25,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Wait a minute...!</font>

201
00:11:26,290 --> 00:11:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you're also an imposter!</font>

202
00:11:30,660 --> 00:11:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you can copy
the appearance and scent,</font>

203
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:35,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can't go so far as
copy Ninjutsu, right?!</font>

204
00:11:35,710 --> 00:11:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Akamaru.</font>

205
00:11:38,130 --> 00:11:39,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fang Over...?</font>

206
00:11:46,260 --> 00:11:47,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knocked out...?</font>

207
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way. It was just a punch,
and I didn't even use a Jutsu...</font>

208
00:11:51,770 --> 00:11:52,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it...</font>

209
00:11:53,150 --> 00:11:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was slugged good and hard,
but I didn't feel it at all.</font>

210
00:11:57,520 --> 00:12:00,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Weren't you going
to mess up the village?!</font>

211
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:03,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are utterly weak!</font>

212
00:12:04,780 --> 00:12:05,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

213
00:12:06,330 --> 00:12:09,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll catch the fake Hinata,
so you handle yourself somehow!</font>

214
00:12:09,950 --> 00:12:11,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave me to me!</font>

215
00:12:11,210 --> 00:12:12,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

216
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

217
00:12:18,630 --> 00:12:21,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if I got overly ambitious
and borrowed too many books...</font>

218
00:12:29,430 --> 00:12:32,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto!</font>

219
00:12:33,020 --> 00:12:34,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

220
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:40,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You moron!</font>

221
00:12:40,860 --> 00:12:43,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your butt is so heavy
you fell right on it!</font>

222
00:12:44,610 --> 00:12:46,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ugly! Ugly!</font>

223
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:50,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forehead girl!</font>

224
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:56,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kick your butt
the next time I see you!</font>

225
00:12:57,500 --> 00:13:00,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kick your butt,
no matter what!</font>

226
00:13:00,750 --> 00:13:02,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, get out of the way!</font>

227
00:13:03,760 --> 00:13:05,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

228
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:08,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kick your butt!</font>

229
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:12,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

230
00:13:18,020 --> 00:13:18,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

231
00:13:19,690 --> 00:13:23,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why's the Naruto who ran that way
coming from over here?</font>

232
00:13:26,570 --> 00:13:28,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm off on a delivery.</font>

233
00:13:28,410 --> 00:13:29,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. Take care.</font>

234
00:13:34,330 --> 00:13:36,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?! You okay, Ayame?!</font>

235
00:13:36,580 --> 00:13:40,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. Naruto suddenly flew in...</font>

236
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

237
00:13:44,090 --> 00:13:47,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Na-ru-to!</font>

238
00:13:48,090 --> 00:13:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare you do that
to my daughter...?!</font>

239
00:13:50,970 --> 00:13:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

240
00:13:53,430 --> 00:13:55,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm okay, Dad.</font>

241
00:13:56,060 --> 00:13:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, you rest a bit.</font>

242
00:13:58,730 --> 00:14:01,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will have Naruto take the responsibility
and make the delivery!</font>

243
00:14:01,730 --> 00:14:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

244
00:14:04,230 --> 00:14:05,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, but I...</font>

245
00:14:06,030 --> 00:14:07,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you refuse,</font>

246
00:14:08,030 --> 00:14:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll never let you eat
my ramen ever again!</font>

247
00:14:13,830 --> 00:14:17,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't the time for me
to be making a delivery!</font>

248
00:14:17,410 --> 00:14:18,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finished the delivery!</font>

249
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Good work!</font>

250
00:14:20,130 --> 00:14:21,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did he go?!</font>

251
00:14:22,130 --> 00:14:23,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My... imposter!</font>

252
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This jerk was also weak...</font>

253
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:36,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba... Stop... Forgive me...</font>

254
00:14:36,810 --> 00:14:42,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That might've worked on Naruto.
But I hate soppy stuff...</font>

255
00:14:42,520 --> 00:14:44,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like that!</font>

256
00:14:48,570 --> 00:14:51,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did these guys seriously
intend to attack the village...?</font>

257
00:14:52,490 --> 00:14:54,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you, imposter?!</font>

258
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:56,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come out!</font>

259
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:57,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

260
00:14:58,460 --> 00:14:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

261
00:15:01,170 --> 00:15:05,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that I came here?</font>

262
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:06,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, you did.</font>

263
00:15:07,210 --> 00:15:10,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be paying me
for what you ate earlier.</font>

264
00:15:11,260 --> 00:15:12,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That jerk...!</font>

265
00:15:24,980 --> 00:15:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forty-five plates...</font>

266
00:15:36,450 --> 00:15:37,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

267
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:52,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eating and running with
someone else's face...</font>

268
00:15:52,970 --> 00:15:54,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That imposter...</font>

269
00:15:55,550 --> 00:16:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not messing up the village,
he's messing up my reputation.</font>

270
00:16:01,810 --> 00:16:02,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

271
00:16:03,350 --> 00:16:04,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...!</font>

272
00:16:13,660 --> 00:16:16,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My Golden Delicious Ninja Way
Ramen Pure Heart of Fire</font>

273
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:17,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd been setting aside!</font>

274
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't allow it...!</font>

275
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:26,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what, I won't allow it...!</font>

276
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:29,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

277
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:33,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Go!
— Go!</font>

278
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:36,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Where is he?!
— Where's the imposter?!</font>

279
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:39,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Where are you?!
— Imposter!</font>

280
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:41,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you?! Come out!</font>

281
00:16:41,640 --> 00:16:43,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill you, imposter!</font>

282
00:16:45,060 --> 00:16:47,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll pay the bill later!</font>

283
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Find him!
— Where is he?!</font>

284
00:16:50,650 --> 00:16:51,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There he is!</font>

285
00:16:55,910 --> 00:16:56,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

286
00:17:01,160 --> 00:17:03,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I won't let you get away!
— Got you!</font>

287
00:17:03,410 --> 00:17:05,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I've got you!
— You're wrong!</font>

288
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:07,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Is it you?!
— I'm not an imposter!</font>

289
00:17:07,210 --> 00:17:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down, guys!</font>

290
00:17:09,630 --> 00:17:13,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The imposter isn't carrying
a chest on his back!</font>

291
00:17:13,630 --> 00:17:16,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?
— It's not him?</font>

292
00:17:17,090 --> 00:17:19,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Now that you mention it...
— That's right.</font>

293
00:17:19,430 --> 00:17:20,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

294
00:17:20,930 --> 00:17:21,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

295
00:17:25,730 --> 00:17:26,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's him!</font>

296
00:17:27,350 --> 00:17:29,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes!</font>

297
00:17:32,730 --> 00:17:36,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the end of the day,
these guys were nothing special.</font>

298
00:17:37,030 --> 00:17:40,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, are these guys really
Orochimaru's henchmen?</font>

299
00:17:40,870 --> 00:17:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows?</font>

300
00:17:41,990 --> 00:17:44,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hokage will look
into the details for us.</font>

301
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:45,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

302
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:47,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, I'm tired.</font>

303
00:17:47,710 --> 00:17:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My shoulders got stiff from carrying
this thing around the whole time.</font>

304
00:17:54,550 --> 00:17:56,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Kiba!</font>

305
00:17:56,380 --> 00:17:58,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, the real Hinata's come back.</font>

306
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:02,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Hinata! Over here!</font>

307
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:03,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

308
00:18:05,770 --> 00:18:09,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not carrying the chest on his back...
Then this Naruto...</font>

309
00:18:14,280 --> 00:18:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's the imposter!</font>

310
00:18:17,860 --> 00:18:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist!</font>

311
00:18:21,410 --> 00:18:24,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, boy. I feel bad for that Naruto...</font>

312
00:18:27,750 --> 00:18:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— What?!</font>

313
00:18:29,830 --> 00:18:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A test?!</font>

314
00:18:32,130 --> 00:18:33,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This mission was a test</font>

315
00:18:33,710 --> 00:18:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to see the teamwork
of you three.</font>

316
00:18:38,010 --> 00:18:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shinobi will often have to
form teams with various others</font>

317
00:18:42,010 --> 00:18:44,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in response to the qualities
and conditions of the mission.</font>

318
00:18:45,310 --> 00:18:46,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At such times,</font>

319
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:50,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">failing if teamed with
a certain other person is a problem.</font>

320
00:18:51,610 --> 00:18:55,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so I gave you a mission
that was easy at the start.</font>

321
00:18:55,690 --> 00:18:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I made it so along
the way...</font>

322
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">something would happen
involving a village crisis.</font>

323
00:19:00,780 --> 00:19:01,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time,</font>

324
00:19:01,820 --> 00:19:04,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to see whether
you could handle it as a team.</font>

325
00:19:04,870 --> 00:19:05,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's what it was...</font>

326
00:19:05,950 --> 00:19:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's harsh!</font>

327
00:19:07,500 --> 00:19:10,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We would've died if
we'd made the slightest mistake.</font>

328
00:19:12,630 --> 00:19:17,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay. I got the story about
you guys from Tsunade-sama.</font>

329
00:19:18,170 --> 00:19:20,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was set up so even if
you were to make a mistake,</font>

330
00:19:20,260 --> 00:19:21,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you would only be injured.</font>

331
00:19:21,760 --> 00:19:24,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since this time around
you had the Ninja Hound-dog Akamaru,</font>

332
00:19:24,390 --> 00:19:26,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I enlisted the help
of the Kedouin Clan...</font>

333
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so you wouldn't be able
to distinguish the enemy.</font>

334
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:33,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And?</font>

335
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:35,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How did these three do?</font>

336
00:19:35,690 --> 00:19:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me see...</font>

337
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:43,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They floundered part of the way
and I was worried about the outcome...</font>

338
00:19:46,490 --> 00:19:49,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I shall pass them.</font>

339
00:19:49,660 --> 00:19:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In terms of results,
they did capture us, so...</font>

340
00:19:55,210 --> 00:19:56,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yeah.</font>

341
00:19:57,630 --> 00:19:58,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...!</font>

342
00:19:58,670 --> 00:20:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was more or less
our mission to bring this, so.</font>

343
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:04,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, our mission is complete.</font>

344
00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:07,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point in going
to the trouble of bringing...</font>

345
00:20:07,100 --> 00:20:07,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no.</font>

346
00:20:08,220 --> 00:20:13,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is something important inside
that I must give to you, Hokage-sama.</font>

347
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:18,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Farewell, Naruto. Take it easy.</font>

348
00:20:18,940 --> 00:20:20,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, too.</font>

349
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:21,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— See ya.
— Yeah.</font>

350
00:20:26,740 --> 00:20:28,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are they going to look
like that forever?</font>

351
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they'll get their own faces back
naturally in a few days.</font>

352
00:20:33,330 --> 00:20:34,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

353
00:20:35,210 --> 00:20:36,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this...?!</font>

354
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:40,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"INVOICE RE: NINJA PROFICIENCY TEST FOR
NARUTO UZUMAKI, KIBA INUZUKA, HINATA HYUGA"</b></font>

355
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:40,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A bill for the recent training...?!</font>

356
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:44,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here... he said he'd be glad
to cooperate...</font>

357
00:20:45,090 --> 00:20:46,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It comes to this much?</font>

358
00:20:47,850 --> 00:20:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a hard world to live in,
isn't it?</font>

359
00:20:51,560 --> 00:20:53,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Tsunade...</font>

360
00:20:54,060 --> 00:20:56,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My concern now is a debt
that absolutely will not go down.</font>

361
00:20:57,230 --> 00:20:59,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More like, it's growing, isn't it?</font>

362
00:21:00,730 --> 00:21:04,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I shouldn't have become...
the likes of Hokage...!</font>

363
00:21:19,810 --> 00:21:23,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>kaze ga fuite aa</b></font></font></font>

