<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>decisive, encounter, life, mutual love</b></font></font></font>

401
00:22:39,420 --> 00:22:43,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">No, it's gone, gone, gone!
Where'd you put it, Naruto?</font>

402
00:22:43,250 --> 00:22:45,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Oh, if you mean that, I wrote it.</font>

403
00:22:45,260 --> 00:22:45,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You wrote it?</font>

404
00:22:46,010 --> 00:22:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">And I gave it to
a Delivery Ninja.</font>

405
00:22:47,260 --> 00:22:48,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You gave it?</font>

406
00:22:48,220 --> 00:22:50,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">So it should reach
the other party today.</font>

407
00:22:50,180 --> 00:22:53,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You idiot!
At this rate, my life as a writer will...</font>

408
00:22:53,810 --> 00:22:55,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">More importantly,
let's get the training started.</font>

409
00:22:55,930 --> 00:22:58,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Shut up and come with me, Naruto!</font>

410
00:22:58,480 --> 00:23:00,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">We have to get that back at any cost!</font>

411
00:23:01,150 --> 00:23:04,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Oh?! Please ♥ Mister Postman."</font>

